{"resource":"budget_figure","about":"What a budget document said a line would be, or was. Stage is proposed, settled or actual.","count":9503,"columns":["line_key","label","fy","stage","variant","value","documents_disagree","doc_id"],"caveats":["A STAGE IS NOT A PERIOD. There is no join between this table and `ledger_snapshot` and nothing should invent one.","An \"actual\" here is a RESTATEMENT: a prior year re-presented by the people who spent it, inside the argument for the next budget. It is not a ledger figure.","These lines do NOT sum back to the district totals -- between 0.1% and 1.6% out. Never apportion a total across them.","`documents_disagree` marks a figure two documents state differently. The documents disagree with themselves by up to 1.5%, which is larger than most variances anybody wants to measure.","FY2021 is unusable: 117 of 120 lines print the budget under an \"actual\" heading. Exclude it."],"note":"9,503 rows is more than one fetch should carry, so this is an index. Each file below is one fy.","source":"https://lunenburgbudgetproject.org/docs/data/budget-figure.csv","parts":[{"url":"https://lunenburgbudgetproject.org/api/budget_figure/2014","fy":"2014","rows":282,"bytes":67815},{"url":"https://lunenburgbudgetproject.org/api/budget_figure/2015","fy":"2015","rows":311,"bytes":76083},{"url":"https://lunenburgbudgetproject.org/api/budget_figure/2016","fy":"2016","rows":334,"bytes":82732},{"url":"https://lunenburgbudgetproject.org/api/budget_figure/2017-1","fy":"2017","rows":510,"bytes":127457},{"url":"https://lunenburgbudgetproject.org/api/budget_figure/2017-2","fy":"2017","rows":41,"bytes":13454},{"url":"https://lunenburgbudgetproject.org/api/budget_figure/2018-1","fy":"2018","rows":500,"bytes":128358},{"url":"https://lunenburgbudgetproject.org/api/budget_figure/2018-2","fy":"2018","rows":308,"bytes":80585},{"url":"https://lunenburgbudgetproject.org/api/budget_figure/2019-1","fy":"2019","rows":533,"bytes":128587},{"url":"https://lunenburgbudgetpr